sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Claude
  participant M as MCP endpoint
  participant D as SQLite
  loop every publish
    C->>M: publish_markdown
    alt token valid
      M->>D: insert version
      D-->>M: row id
    else expired
      M-->>C: 401 unauthorized
    end
    opt tags supplied
      M->>D: upsert tags
    end
  end
  par notify
    M-->>C: artifact url
  and index
    M->>D: refresh search
  end
